# OpenTerminal — backend proxy URL
# The component calls this URL; your backend securely holds the actual OPEN_TERMINAL_API_KEY.
# NEVER use a VITE_-prefixed variable for the API key — it would be embedded in the client bundle.
#
# Option 1: point at an existing backend endpoint that proxies to OpenTerminal
VITE_OPEN_TERMINAL_PROXY_URL=/api/terminal
#
# Option 2 (server-side only — NOT prefixed with VITE_):
# OPEN_TERMINAL_URL=http://localhost:8000
# OPEN_TERMINAL_API_KEY=your-secret-key
